#: ../../../integration/ci/index.rst:15
msgid "Continuous Integration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ci/index.rst:17
msgid ""
"`Continuous Integration (CI, wiki) <http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Continuous_integration>`_ is the practice, in software engineering, of "
"merging all developer working copies with a shared mainline several times a "
"day."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ci/index.rst:21
msgid ""
":ref:`cmd_ci` command is intended to be used in combination with the build "
"servers and the popular `Continuous Integration Software <http://en."
"wikipedia.org/wiki/Comparison_of_continuous_integration_software>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../integration/ci/index.rst:25
msgid ""
"By integrating regularly, you can detect errors quickly, and locate them "
"more easily."
msgstr ""
